  "notes": [
    "Hand-locked from TfL published maps / What we do / Overground six-name launch (28 Nov 2024). Never generate chips from GTFS or compass.",
    "Modes v1: tube, elizabeth-line, dlr, overground, tram. No buses, no NR-only.",
    "\u00a73 chips are line + terminus. Circle is a loop, not a terminus chip (same rule as Sydney City Circle).",
    "Overground line ids: lioness, mildmay, windrush, weaver, suffragette, liberty.",
    "Shared complexes (Paddington LU vs Elizabeth, King's Cross children) stay separate StopPoints. Do not merge NR into this oracle.",
    "Short workings nest under the published terminus (see shortTurns). Do not promote a short as a primary chip.",
    "Station lists below are termini and published ends for chips, not a substitute for stops.json."
  ],
  "chipRule": "lineName + ' ' + terminus",
